| Interface  | Register         | Offset | Width | Access | Description                      | Bit Fields                                                                         |
+------------+------------------+--------+-------+--------+----------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| s_axi_CTRL | CTRL             | 0x00   | 32    | RW     | Control signals                  | 0=AP_START 1=AP_DONE 2=AP_IDLE 3=AP_READY 4=AP_CONTINUE 7=AUTO_RESTART 9=INTERRUPT |
| s_axi_CTRL | GIER             | 0x04   | 32    | RW     | Global Interrupt Enable Register | 0=Enable                                                                           |
| s_axi_CTRL | IP_IER           | 0x08   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Enable Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_EN 1=CHAN1_INT_EN                                                      |
| s_axi_CTRL | IP_ISR           | 0x0c   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Status Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_ST 1=CHAN1_INT_ST                                                      |
| s_axi_CTRL | num_outs         | 0x20   | 32    | W      | Data signal of num_outs          |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_CTRL | start_addr_1     | 0x30   | 32    | W      | Data signal of start_addr        |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_CTRL | start_addr_2     | 0x34   | 32    | W      | Data signal of start_addr        |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_CTRL | ms_maxi_srcbuf_1 | 0x40   | 32    | W      | Data signal of ms_maxi_srcbuf    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_CTRL | ms_maxi_srcbuf_2 | 0x44   | 32    | W      | Data signal of ms_maxi_srcbuf    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_CTRL | ms_maxi_dstbuf_1 | 0x50   | 32    | W      | Data signal of ms_maxi_dstbuf    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_CTRL | ms_maxi_dstbuf_2 | 0x54   | 32    | W      | Data signal of ms_maxi_dstbuf    |                                                                                    |
